<h3>City of Tulsa Elections</h3>
<p>The City of Tulsa election schedule for elected officials is governed by <u><a href="https://library.municode.com/ok/tulsa/codes/code_of_ordinances?nodeId=COOR_1989AMCH_ARTVIELQUOF" target="_blank" title="Article VI of the City of Tulsa Charter">Article VI</a> </u>of the City of Tulsa Charter. </p>
<p>2026 City of Tulsa schedule for elected official elections:</p>
<table border="0" width="541" class="table table-striped">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td width="137">
<p>Filing Period</p>
</td>
<td width="380">
<p>Monday, June 8 - Wednesday, June 10, 2026</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="137">
<p>General Election</p>
</td>
<td width="380">
<p>Tuesday, August 25, 2026</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="137">
<p>Run-off Election</p>
</td>
<td width="380">
<p>Tuesday, November 3, 2026</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<hr />
<p><a data-id="46802" href="/media/30660/2026-election-packet.pdf" target="_blank" title="Download the 2026 Election Packet">Download the 2026 Election Packet</a></p>
<hr />
<p><a href="https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/bfe2644da8034a5abafd91d579986978" target="_blank" title="Council District Finder Map">Council District Finder Map</a></p>
<hr />
<p><strong>City of Tulsa Elected Official Terms:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>The Mayor of Tulsa is elected for four-year terms</li>
<li><span>City Auditor is elected for four-year terms</span></li>
<li>City Councilors are elected for two-year terms</li>
</ul>
<p>As of November 1, 2025<strong>, <a data-id="11652" href="/government/departments/finance/city-clerks-office/elections/campaign-contribution-reports/" title="Campaign Contribution Reports">campaign contribution forms</a></strong> must be filed with Oklahoma Ethics Commission. Please visit oklahoma.gov/ethics for guidance on filing procedures or contact their office at <a href="mailto:ethics@ethics.ok.gov" target="_blank" title="E-mail Ethics at the State of Oklahoma Ethics Commission">ethics@ethics.ok.gov</a> or (405) 521-3451 for more information.</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Helpful Resources</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://www2.tulsacounty.org/electionboard/" target="_blank" title="Tulsa County Election Board">Tulsa County Election Board</a><br /> <a href="https://ok.gov/elections/" target="_blank" title="Oklahoma State Election Board">Oklahoma State Election Board</a><br /><a href="https://www2.tulsacounty.org/electionboard/voting/voter-registration/" target="_blank" title="Voter Registration">Voter Registration</a><br /><a href="https://www2.tulsacounty.org/electionboard/voting/absentee-voting/" target="_blank" title="Absentee Ballot">Absentee Ballot</a><br /><a href="https://www.ok.gov/ethics/Campaigns/Municipal_Campaigns.html" target="_blank" title="Oklahoma Ethics Commission Municipal Reporting">Oklahoma Ethics Commission Municipal Reporting</a></p>

	

